                                                "sense_id": "52faee41-fdf3-3711-9dbf-e699a78bd20b",
                                                "text": "When you write about using a waterproof laser pointer while scuba diving, you probably aren’t going to write about “a L.A.S.E.R. pointer for S.C.U.B.A. diving”, because the words laser and scuba are anacronyms."
